WEBVTT

1
00:00:35,452 --> 00:00:36,828
Halo?

2
00:00:36,911 --> 00:00:38,747
<i>Halo. Modesta?</i>

3
00:00:40,123 --> 00:00:41,416
Siapa ini?

4
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:44,377
Tentu, akan kucari cara, Bu.

5
00:00:45,545 --> 00:00:47,630
Dencio, kita kembali bekerja!

6
00:00:47,714 --> 00:00:49,841
Cake, di mana Jo?

7
00:00:49,924 --> 00:00:51,217
{\an8}Di sini, Direk!

8
00:00:51,301 --> 00:00:53,470
{\an8}Jaringan mau Dencio muncul lagi, Jo.

9
00:00:53,553 --> 00:00:56,014
{\an8}Bukankah Dencio mati? Ditembak, kan?

10
00:00:56,097 --> 00:00:59,601
{\an8}Kalian mau seri ini dibatalkan?
Tidak, kan?

11
00:00:59,684 --> 00:01:01,144
{\an8}Setuju.

12
00:01:01,227 --> 00:01:03,354
{\an8}Baik, bagaimana cara
menghidupkan yang mati?

13
00:01:03,438 --> 00:01:06,107
{\an8}Kalau jadi hantu?
Dalam mimpi buruk? Reinkarnasi?

14
00:01:06,191 --> 00:01:07,817
{\an8}Ini seri laga, bukan fantasi.

15
00:01:07,901 --> 00:01:10,111
{\an8}Jo, kau penulis, kan? Coba pikirkan.

16
00:01:10,195 --> 00:01:12,113
{\an8}Kalian yang tiba-tiba mengubahnya.

17
00:01:12,197 --> 00:01:13,573
{\an8}Seperti arwah begitu?

18
00:01:13,656 --> 00:01:15,700
{\an8}- Arwah, serius?
- Terima kasih.

19
00:01:15,784 --> 00:01:17,744
{\an8}Direk, bagaimana kalau kembaran?

20
00:01:19,788 --> 00:01:21,081
{\an8}Kembaran.

21
00:01:21,164 --> 00:01:22,373
{\an8}Beres!

22
00:01:22,457 --> 00:01:23,833
{\an8}Dencio punya kembaran.

23
00:01:25,335 --> 00:01:27,420
{\an8}Astaga, Matti!

24
00:01:27,504 --> 00:01:30,006
{\an8}Jika kau tak bawa tas itu, kubunuh kau!

25
00:01:30,089 --> 00:01:32,759
{\an8}Kubilang ada. Kau mengingatkanku 500 kali.

26
00:01:32,842 --> 00:01:34,636
{\an8}- Masa?
- Ya, 500 kali!

27
00:01:34,719 --> 00:01:37,597
{\an8}- Lima ratus! Ternyata kau hitung.
- Ya. Ya, kuhitung. Ya.

28
00:01:38,139 --> 00:01:40,433
{\an8}Jangan sok pintar denganku!

29
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:42,519
{\an8}Berengsek. Sialan!

30
00:01:44,020 --> 00:01:46,022
{\an8}Hei! Kau sopir kami?

31
00:01:46,105 --> 00:01:47,649
{\an8}Paz De Los Santos, Bu?

32
00:01:47,732 --> 00:01:49,943
{\an8}Jangan panggil "bu". Aku masih muda!

33
00:01:50,026 --> 00:01:50,985
{\an8}Biar kubantu, Bu.

34
00:01:51,069 --> 00:01:52,612
{\an8}- Masuk ke mobil.
- Kubawakan.

35
00:01:52,695 --> 00:01:53,780
{\an8}Kubilang jangan "bu".

36
00:01:58,701 --> 00:02:00,078
{\an8}Sial, serius?

37
00:02:00,161 --> 00:02:02,622
{\an8}Ya. Ayahmu akan menjemputnya di dermaga.

38
00:02:02,705 --> 00:02:05,959
{\an8}Bu, aku harus kembali bekerja.
Nanti kutelepon lagi.

39
00:02:06,584 --> 00:02:07,877
{\an8}Halo? Jo?

40
00:02:10,130 --> 00:02:11,756
{\an8}Orang mati telah bangkit.

41
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,674
{\an8}Siapa?

42
00:02:12,757 --> 00:02:15,927
{\an8}Wanita yang hilang tanpa jejak,
dia di sini.

43
00:02:16,594 --> 00:02:17,637
{\an8}Ibu kandungmu?

44
00:02:18,930 --> 00:02:20,765
{\an8}Bunda yang Tak Pernah Hadir?

45
00:02:21,474 --> 00:02:23,685
{\an8}Astaga!

46
00:02:23,768 --> 00:02:26,896
{\an8}Mantan bintang cilik muncul kembali!

47
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:28,940
{\an8}<i>Selamat pagi, Semuanya.</i>

48
00:02:29,023 --> 00:02:32,777
{\an8}<i>Kami menerima</i>
<i>kabar buruk lainnya hari ini.</i>

49
00:02:34,070 --> 00:02:35,697
{\an8}Ini benar-benar tak nyata.

50
00:02:38,533 --> 00:02:40,535
{\an8}Selamat datang di rumah!

51
00:02:40,618 --> 00:02:42,245
{\an8}Sikapmu aneh sekali, Bu!

52
00:02:43,496 --> 00:02:45,039
{\an8}Lalu ada lokakarya juga.

53
00:02:45,123 --> 00:02:47,292
{\an8}Banyak sekali persyaratannya.

54
00:02:47,375 --> 00:02:49,919
{\an8}Sudah butuh ringkasan sekuens secepat ini.

55
00:02:50,003 --> 00:02:51,671
{\an8}Baguslah sudah kuurus visaku.

56
00:02:51,754 --> 00:02:54,591
{\an8}Kau pasti bisa!

57
00:02:54,674 --> 00:02:57,051
{\an8}Kau bahkan membangkitkan orang mati!

58
00:02:57,135 --> 00:02:59,888
{\an8}Delapan belas sekuens, secara langsung!

59
00:02:59,971 --> 00:03:01,431
{\an8}Kau bisa!

60
00:03:01,514 --> 00:03:03,516
{\an8}Amerika itu berbeda.

61
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:06,352
{\an8}Setelah di Amerika,
bisa saja kau dipekerjakan

62
00:03:06,436 --> 00:03:07,770
{\an8}oleh Nona Shonda Rhimes!

63
00:03:08,354 --> 00:03:11,190
{\an8}Orang-orang terkemuka!

64
00:03:12,275 --> 00:03:13,401
Namun, tunggu!

65
00:03:13,484 --> 00:03:15,236
Kau akan meninggalkan semua ini?

66
00:03:16,905 --> 00:03:18,573
- Ini?
- Ya!

67
00:03:20,033 --> 00:03:22,160
- Ya?
- Ya!

68
00:03:22,243 --> 00:03:23,828
Tentu saja!

69
00:03:27,916 --> 00:03:30,835
Bangun, Mattias, bangun!

70
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:32,003
Apa?

71
00:03:33,338 --> 00:03:40,011
Kau harus menciumnya. Ciumlah.
Bau udara laut murni.

72
00:03:40,094 --> 00:03:41,804
Udara laut murni.

73
00:03:41,888 --> 00:03:43,848
Ya, laut.

74
00:03:43,932 --> 00:03:45,141
- Ini.
- Terima kasih.

75
00:03:46,768 --> 00:03:48,436
Aneh rasanya kembali kemari.

76
00:03:48,519 --> 00:03:51,481
Aku yakin mereka semua
bersemangat menemui kita.

77
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:53,274
Masa?

78
00:03:54,067 --> 00:03:55,235
Aku dulu terkenal, tahu?

79
00:03:56,569 --> 00:03:58,029
Sungguh!

80
00:04:00,198 --> 00:04:05,453
Dahulu kala, aku bintang drama
yang sedang naik daun di Manila.

81
00:04:07,664 --> 00:04:09,666
Apa sampai ke puncak?

82
00:04:11,709 --> 00:04:14,045
Kau mau kudorong?

83
00:04:15,463 --> 00:04:16,714
Sepertinya sudah sampai.

84
00:04:24,931 --> 00:04:30,937
{\an8}THIS, THAT
AND EVERYTHING IN BETWEEN

85
00:04:38,653 --> 00:04:40,863
Matti, jaga tasnya!

86
00:04:40,947 --> 00:04:42,240
Mereka tak akan kabur!

87
00:04:42,991 --> 00:04:43,825
Astaga!

88
00:04:50,081 --> 00:04:51,124
Rene!

89
00:04:54,627 --> 00:04:56,045
Rene!

90
00:04:56,129 --> 00:04:57,171
Apa benar itu kau?

91
00:04:57,755 --> 00:04:58,881
Astaga!

92
00:04:58,965 --> 00:05:01,259
- Masukkan di belakang.
- Siapa itu?

93
00:05:01,342 --> 00:05:03,720
- Kau masih naik ini?
- Ya, kau tahu.

94
00:05:03,803 --> 00:05:06,681
Aku tak main buang barang,
kecuali sudah rusak.

95
00:05:06,764 --> 00:05:07,682
Siapa ini?

96
00:05:08,725 --> 00:05:09,559
Putraku.

97
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:12,145
Selamat datang.

98
00:05:12,228 --> 00:05:13,688
Jangan sungkan!

99
00:05:13,771 --> 00:05:15,356
Cepat!

100
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:17,233
Terima kasih!

101
00:05:17,317 --> 00:05:18,609
Hati-hati, Matti!

102
00:05:21,237 --> 00:05:22,322
Sudah semua?

103
00:05:23,614 --> 00:05:24,949
Sudah!

104
00:05:25,033 --> 00:05:26,993
- Kau baik-baik saja, Matti?
- Ya.

105
00:05:27,076 --> 00:05:29,579
- Kotaknya ada di atas?
- Ya.

106
00:05:49,974 --> 00:05:51,225
Nah.

107
00:05:51,309 --> 00:05:53,519
Pasti rumah ini merindukanmu.

108
00:06:00,860 --> 00:06:03,321
Kuminta Claro membersihkan rumah ini.

109
00:06:03,404 --> 00:06:05,281
Ingat pesuruh kita dahulu?

110
00:06:05,364 --> 00:06:07,241
Dia sudah besar sekarang.

111
00:06:22,215 --> 00:06:25,843
Jo pakai kamar lamamu setiap kali datang.

112
00:06:25,927 --> 00:06:27,970
Namun, anak itu juga jarang pulang.

113
00:06:28,721 --> 00:06:30,723
Kami juga sudah menyiapkan kamar ayahmu.

114
00:06:31,891 --> 00:06:34,727
Di mana orang yang bersamamu?

115
00:06:39,732 --> 00:06:41,692
Ini Matti, anak bungsuku.

116
00:06:42,401 --> 00:06:44,862
Wah, tampan sekali!

117
00:06:45,571 --> 00:06:47,115
Kau seperti selebritas!

118
00:06:47,824 --> 00:06:49,200
Salim pada Des.

119
00:06:49,283 --> 00:06:51,619
Dia mirip ibunya!

120
00:06:52,787 --> 00:06:55,414
Astaga, cium pipi saja!

121
00:06:59,627 --> 00:07:02,380
Ayo, mari masuk.
Apa dia bisa bahasa Tagalog?

122
00:07:13,558 --> 00:07:16,144
Mattias! Hentikan itu!

123
00:07:34,203 --> 00:07:35,413
Ayah.

124
00:07:35,496 --> 00:07:40,084
<i>Jo, Sayang, segeralah pulang.</i>
<i>Ibumu ingin menemuimu.</i>

125
00:07:44,672 --> 00:07:46,841
Ayah, pekerjaanku masih banyak.

126
00:07:46,924 --> 00:07:49,469
<i>Nak, luangkan waktu untuk keluarga juga.</i>

127
00:07:49,552 --> 00:07:52,472
<i>Jangan menghabiskan semua waktumu bekerja.</i>

128
00:07:53,306 --> 00:07:55,683
<i>Sudah lama kau tak pulang.</i>

129
00:07:56,559 --> 00:07:58,102
<i>Ayo pulang.</i>

130
00:07:58,186 --> 00:07:59,770
<i>Sudah lama sejak…</i>

131
00:07:59,854 --> 00:08:00,980
Aduh!

132
00:08:01,063 --> 00:08:03,483
<i>Kenapa? Kau tak apa-apa?</i>

133
00:08:04,066 --> 00:08:05,359
Ayah, nanti kutelepon lagi.

134
00:08:06,068 --> 00:08:07,195
<i>Apa kau…</i>

135
00:08:17,914 --> 00:08:20,333
Tak pernah berhenti!

136
00:08:21,417 --> 00:08:25,963
Baiklah, ceritakan.
Mari atasi satu demi satu.

137
00:08:26,047 --> 00:08:28,090
Ingatlah, kau berada di tempat aman.

138
00:08:28,174 --> 00:08:31,135
Lokakaryanya… Aku bukan mengeluh.

139
00:08:32,136 --> 00:08:39,060
Maksudku, ini peluangku untuk…
untuk sungguh buat kehidupanku lebih baik.

140
00:08:39,894 --> 00:08:44,148
Hanya saja, makin dekat,
makin banyak keraguanku apakah…

141
00:08:45,316 --> 00:08:47,485
apakah ini benar untuk kulakukan.

142
00:08:47,568 --> 00:08:52,990
Karena aku merasa… Entahlah.
Merasa ada yang kurang.

143
00:08:54,242 --> 00:08:58,454
Aku tahu ini film bagus
dan bisa mengubah hidupku, tetapi…

144
00:08:59,372 --> 00:09:04,627
aku merasa ada sesuatu
yang harus kulakukan sebelumnya.

145
00:09:04,710 --> 00:09:07,797
Apa kita membahas perjalanannya…

146
00:09:07,880 --> 00:09:09,715
atau ada hal lain yang mengusikmu?

147
00:09:19,475 --> 00:09:21,477
Paz di sini.

148
00:09:30,486 --> 00:09:31,529
Astaga.

149
00:09:33,948 --> 00:09:35,658
Dia kembali.

150
00:09:37,410 --> 00:09:40,830
Tepat saat aku sudah bisa
melanjutkan hidupku…

151
00:09:41,622 --> 00:09:43,833
Aku harus membuka luka lamaku?

152
00:09:45,334 --> 00:09:47,837
{\an8}Lalu Ayah ingin aku pulang.

153
00:09:48,546 --> 00:09:52,049
Seolah secara tiba-tiba,
semuanya baik-baik saja.

154
00:09:52,133 --> 00:09:55,595
Maksudku, aku tak kenal orang ini.

155
00:09:56,971 --> 00:09:58,931
Dia tak pernah peduli padaku.

156
00:10:00,349 --> 00:10:02,059
Itu yang tak mereka pahami.

157
00:10:02,143 --> 00:10:06,397
Bahwa sangat berat bagiku
untuk sampai ke titik ini.

158
00:10:07,898 --> 00:10:10,276
Tentu, masih keluarga, kan?

159
00:10:10,359 --> 00:10:14,030
Namun, sialnya, mau bagaimana
jika itu keluarga yang kau miliki?

160
00:10:15,323 --> 00:10:16,490
Benar, kan?

161
00:10:19,493 --> 00:10:20,953
Maka jangan pergi.

162
00:10:22,204 --> 00:10:23,205
Jangan pergi.

163
00:10:24,665 --> 00:10:26,709
Kau punya kehidupanmu sekarang.

164
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:30,880
Pilihan di tanganmu.

165
00:10:32,548 --> 00:10:34,216
Ingat yang kita bicarakan soal…

166
00:10:35,384 --> 00:10:37,136
batasan pribadi.

167
00:10:37,219 --> 00:10:39,305
Batasan, ya.

168
00:10:40,473 --> 00:10:42,600
Itu bukan hal egois, Jo.

169
00:10:43,184 --> 00:10:45,895
Baiklah. Batasan.

170
00:10:47,188 --> 00:10:48,272
Ya.

171
00:10:49,023 --> 00:10:49,982
Kemari.

172
00:10:51,233 --> 00:10:52,360
Tangan yang satunya.

173
00:10:54,987 --> 00:10:56,947
Tarik napas, ya?

174
00:10:57,031 --> 00:10:58,199
Tarik napas dalam.

175
00:10:59,867 --> 00:11:03,120
Dua, tiga, empat. Tahan.

176
00:11:03,788 --> 00:11:09,669
Embuskan. Dua, tiga, empat, tahan.

177
00:11:09,752 --> 00:11:11,462
{\an8}Pilihan di tanganmu.

178
00:11:11,545 --> 00:11:12,922
{\an8}Pilihan di tanganku.

179
00:11:13,005 --> 00:11:17,968
{\an8}Sekali lagi. Tarik napas.
Dua, tiga, empat.

180
00:11:18,052 --> 00:11:19,470
Tahan.

181
00:12:15,901 --> 00:12:17,695
Sial!

182
00:12:18,779 --> 00:12:19,989
Sayang sekali!

183
00:12:20,072 --> 00:12:20,990
Hilang sudah.

184
00:12:22,158 --> 00:12:24,743
Kau tertawa? Sayang sekali.

185
00:12:34,170 --> 00:12:35,546
Kau tak bosan di sini?

186
00:12:38,466 --> 00:12:43,179
Kau tahu, tak ada yang membosankan
dari hidup damai.

187
00:12:46,557 --> 00:12:47,892
Biar kutanya.

188
00:12:48,642 --> 00:12:51,312
Apa kelebihan di sana dari di sini?

189
00:12:51,395 --> 00:12:52,688
