00:15:07,573 --> 00:15:08,657
Berengsek!

209
00:15:11,493 --> 00:15:13,287
Apa dia… Joanne?

210
00:15:13,954 --> 00:15:15,039
Joanne!

211
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:18,667
Joanne!

212
00:15:25,090 --> 00:15:26,258
Joanne!

213
00:15:27,593 --> 00:15:30,346
Joanne! Ini aku!

214
00:15:32,097 --> 00:15:34,141
Kenapa tak bilang kau akan pulang?

215
00:15:36,185 --> 00:15:37,227
Joanne!

216
00:15:37,311 --> 00:15:38,562
Aku sedang pipis!

217
00:15:38,646 --> 00:15:40,856
Joanne! Sudah bertemu adikmu?

218
