220
00:15:48,489 --> 00:15:49,865
Joanne!

221
00:15:56,163 --> 00:15:58,540
Aku senang sekali!

222
00:15:58,624 --> 00:16:02,169
Dua anak sulungku bertemu.

223
00:16:02,252 --> 00:16:05,339
- Matti, kenalkan kakakmu, Joanne!
- Jo saja.

224
00:16:05,422 --> 00:16:07,925
